# Shop-Books web (Vite) configuration. Copy to web/.env.local (gitignored) only if you need to override.
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser bundle. NEVER put secrets or database
# credentials in this file: everything here is visible to anyone who loads the site.

# Base URL of the API. Default "/api/v1" (same origin; in development Vite proxies /api to
# http://localhost:3000). Set a full URL (e.g. https://api.example.com/api/v1) if the API is on
# a different origin, and add the web origin to FRONTEND_URL on the server.
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
